# Local Repositories Map (Home Repo Pointer)

> Copy to `./repos.local.md` (gitignored) or run `./scripts/init_workspace.sh`.
> Agents read this file via `AGENTS.md` to resolve `$DATA_REPO` and any additional repositories.

## Primary Data Repo (`$DATA_REPO`)

- **Path**: `<DATA_REPO_PATH>`
- **Purpose**: Private personal goals, preferences, suggestion queues, generated reports, and delivery logs.
- **Key directories**:
  - `$DATA_REPO/data/` — `lang_preferences.md`, `goals.md`, `user_preferences.md`, `rubric_blocklist.md`, `suggestions_*.md`, `integrations.md`, `newsletter_aliases.json`
  - `$DATA_REPO/reports/` — `Newsletter_YYYY_MM_DD/`, `Threads_YYYY_MM_DD/`, `Website_YYYY_MM_DD/`, `YouTube_YYYY_MM_DD/`, `distillations/`

